        {
          "@id": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5K6PCYBKXQT8JFYYHCZMKG6/fact/fact_01M5K6PDJ04HF1S42RH0XKSGEW",
          "@type": "rs:Fact",
          "element": "cadence:OperatingExpensePolicyTextBlock",
          "entity": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5K6PCYBKXQT8JFYYHCZMKG6/entity/entity_kg1a166518e7de879915d1",
          "factSet": "https://robosystems.ai/factset/fs_01M5K6PDHZAA9S8778MM7G88AR",
          "factType": "nonnumeric",
          "internalId": "fact_01M5K6PDJ04HF1S42RH0XKSGEW",
          "language": "en",
          "period": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5K6PCYBKXQT8JFYYHCZMKG6/period/p_3",
          "stringValue": "<h1>Operating Expense &amp; Burn Policy — Cadence Labs, Inc.</h1>\n<h2>Expense classification (by function)</h2>\n<p>| Function | Account | Includes |\n|---|---|---|\n| Cost of Revenue | 5000 | Cloud hosting, customer support |\n| Research &amp; Development | 6000 | Engineering salaries, product development |\n| Sales &amp; Marketing | 6100 | Sales team, commissions, advertising |\n| General &amp; Administrative | 6200 / 6300 / 6400 | Admin, finance, legal, rent, software tools |</p>\n<p>R&amp;D is expensed as incurred (no internal-use software capitalization in this policy).</p>\n<h2>Depreciation &amp; Prepaids</h2>\n<p>Straight-line. Equipment over 36 months; the office build-out over 60 months (DR Depreciation Expense 7000 / CR Accumulated Depreciation 1350). Annual tooling and insurance are capitalized as prepaids and amortized over 12 months.</p>\n<h2>Burn &amp; runway</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Monthly operating burn</strong> ≈ operating loss + non-cash addbacks (depreciation/amortization), adjusted for working-capital movements.</li>\n<li><strong>Runway</strong> = cash ÷ net monthly burn. Report it net of deferred revenue: the prepayment float inflates the cash balance with obligations owed as service.</li>\n</ul>",
          "structure": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5K6PCYBKXQT8JFYYHCZMKG6/structure/struct_01M5K6NT5VJCSNVQD6YWGFQ751"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://robosystems.ai/report/rpt_01M5K6PCYBKXQT8JFYYHCZMKG6/fact/fact_01M5K6PDJ04HF1S42RH0XKSGEX",
          "@type": "rs:Fact",
          "element": "cadence:RevenueRecognitionPolicyTextBlock",
